[h1]Kenshi Achievements[/h1]
Tracks every [b]kill[/b] and [b]knockout[/b] your squad makes, per character, and unlocks [b]achievements[/b] with an in-game popup and sound. Press [b]F6[/b] for the stats panel.

[h2]⚠️ REQUIRES RE_KENSHI[/h2]
This is an [b]RE_Kenshi plugin[/b] (a DLL). Without RE_Kenshi it does nothing.
[list]
[*][b][url=https://www.nexusmods.com/kenshi/mods/847]RE_Kenshi v0.3.5 or newer[/url][/b] ([url=https://github.com/BFrizzleFoShizzle/RE_Kenshi/releases]GitHub[/url]) — install it first, then subscribe here and enable [b]KenshiAchievements[/b] in the launcher.
[*]The main menu should read "RE_Kenshi v0.3.5" (or newer).
[/list]

[h2]Features[/h2]
[list]
[*][b]Kill & knockout counter per squad member[/b] — kills and KOs counted separately, plus totals by victim race and faction.
[*]Works for melee, ranged, animals and [b]stealth knockouts / assassinations[/b].
[*][b]Achievements[/b] with an on-screen popup, a message-log entry and Kenshi's own notification sound (follows your game volume).
[*][b]F6 panel[/b] with two tabs:
[list]
[*][b]Statistics[/b] — the selected character at the top, then the squad total and every character.
[*][b]Achievements[/b] — completed and in progress, with progress like (3/10).
[/list]
[*]Stats are saved [b]inside your save file[/b] — each save has its own counters.
[*][b]Any game language[/b] — the UI follows Kenshi's language setting, and translated race/faction names are mapped back to English with the game's own dictionary, so achievements work the same everywhere. Included: English and Português (Brasil).
[/list]

[h2]Customize[/h2]
Everything lives in [b]achievements.txt[/b] inside the mod folder — no recompiling:
[list]
[*]Add or edit achievements: total kills/KOs, best single character, kills of a race or faction (wildcards like [i]*Skeleton*[/i] work great with mods that add variants).
[*][b]@sound[/b] — any Kenshi notification sound, your own .wav, or none.
[*][b]@key[/b] — panel key (default F6; F9 is Kenshi's quickload).
[/list]
Want it in your language? Copy [b]lang/en.txt[/b] to [b]lang/<your language>.txt[/b] (e.g. de_DE.txt, ru_RU.txt) and translate — pull requests welcome!

[h2]Compatibility[/h2]
[list]
[*]Single-player. [b]Not[/b] made for Kenshi multiplayer mods.
[*]Tested with [b]Genesis[/b] and a typical mod list — it only reads combat events and doesn't change game data, so load order doesn't matter.
[*]Works with saves from before you installed it (counting starts from then on).
[*][b]Removing the mod is safe[/b]: saves load normally without it. But a save made while the mod is disabled loses the counters (older saves keep theirs).
[/list]

[h2]Open source[/h2]
Source code, issues and changelog on GitHub: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements]github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements[/url]
Licensed [b]GPLv3[/b] — fork it, change it, learn from it.
⭐ [b]If you like it, leave a like here and a star on GitHub[/b] — that's all I ask!

Found a bug? Open an issue on GitHub. Setting [b]@debug = 1[/b] in achievements.txt writes every kill/KO to [i]RE_Kenshi_log.txt[/i] — attach it to the issue.

